# Licensed BADA 3 mass REPORT/ENFORCE gate. Generated evidence is Git-ignored.
# Run with: IC research/pybada3-envelope-mass
00:00:00.00>ECHO TEST INFO === BADA 3 MASS REPORT AND ENFORCE GATE ===
00:00:00.05>ECHO TEST INFO Bounds are read from the active licensed model and are not embedded in this scenario.
00:00:00.10>ECHO TEST EXPECT A320 resolves to A320__ through bada3-code with valid zero-miss evaluations.
00:00:00.15>PLUGIN LOAD PYBADATEM
00:00:00.20>PLUGIN LOAD RESEARCHRECORDER
00:00:00.25>PERFMODEL BADA3
00:00:00.30>DT 0.05
00:00:00.35>DATE 11,8,2026,12:00:00
00:00:01.00>CRE B3MR,A320,41.30,2.10,90,FL100,250
00:00:01.10>CRE B3ME,A320,41.32,2.10,90,FL100,250
00:00:01.20>DYNAMICS B3MR KINEMATIC
00:00:01.25>DYNAMICS B3ME KINEMATIC
00:00:01.30>ENVELOPECHECKS B3MR CUSTOM MASS_MIN MASS_MAX
00:00:01.35>ENVELOPECHECKS B3ME CUSTOM MASS_MIN MASS_MAX
00:00:01.40>ENVELOPE B3MR OFF
00:00:01.45>ENVELOPE B3ME OFF
00:00:02.00>RECORDRESEARCH START pybada3-envelope-mass.csv
00:00:03.00>ECHO TEST ACTION Assigning a deliberately excessive positive mass while B3MR is OFF.
00:00:03.10>MASS B3MR 100000
00:00:04.00>ECHO TEST ACTION Enabling REPORT on the already infeasible B3MR state.
00:00:04.10>ENVELOPE B3MR REPORT
00:00:04.20>ENVELOPE B3ME ENFORCE
00:00:05.00>ECHO TEST ACTION Verifying fundamental rejection and transactional selected-bound rejection on B3ME.
00:00:05.10>MASS B3ME 0
00:00:05.20>MASS B3ME 100000
00:00:06.00>ECHO TEST ACTION Recovering B3MR with an ordinary test input, then recurring once.
00:00:06.10>MASS B3MR 60000
00:00:07.10>MASS B3MR 100000
00:00:08.00>PERFSTATUS B3MR ALL
00:00:08.10>PERFSTATUS B3ME ALL
00:00:09.00>RECORDRESEARCH STOP
00:00:09.10>ECHO TEST INFO Run validate_bada3_mass.py on output/pybada3-envelope-mass.csv.
00:00:09.20>ECHO TEST EXPECT Three isolated MASS_MAX transitions and transactional ENFORCE preservation.
00:00:10.00>HOLD
